OL,3,GNEWSA'It made me feel like I was
OL,4,Alying': How two thirds of NI people
OL,5,Adenied disability benefit win at
OL,6,Atribunal
OL,7,
OL,8,FA woman who took medical retirement due
OL,9,Fto multiple health issues has said she
OL,10,Fwas made to feel she was "telling lies"
OL,11,Fand ended up suffering from poor mental
OL,12,Fhealth after being turned down for a
OL,13,Fkey disability payment a number of
OL,14,Ftimes.
OL,16,FJanet Wright had the decision to deny
OL,17,Fher Personal Independent Payment (Pip)
OL,18,Foverturned at appeal through a tribunal
OL,19,Fprocess.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
