OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'It made me feel like I was
OL,4,Alying': How two thirds of NI people
OL,5,Adenied disability benefit win at
OL,6,Atribunal
OL,7,
OL,8,FRecent figures from the Department for
OL,9,FCommunities (DfC) show that about two
OL,10,Fout of three cases - or 64% in 2025/26
OL,11,F- that progress to appeal are found in
OL,12,Ffavour of the claimant.
OL,14,FIt said it was committed to "treating
OL,15,Feveryone with dignity, respect and
OL,16,Fempathy throughout their claim
OL,17,Fjourney".
